	(text "We don't need these\nto be very bright\n\nAssume 2 V drop\n@ 1 mA per LED\n\nΔV = IR\nR = ΔV/I\nR = (1.3 V)/(1 mA)\nR = 1.3 kΩ\n\nWe're bumping it\nto 1.6 kΩ to\nfurther reduce \npower draw"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 257.81 67.056 0)
